@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@
+---
+id: task-003-validate-task-input
+type: task
+title: "Validate task input"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Reject invalid task input without changing the list. A title must contain non-whitespace text and be
+at most 120 characters; priority must be `low`, `normal`, or `high`; and every tag must be non-empty
+and contain no space. Apply these checks when adding, renaming, and tagging, returning a clear error
+that identifies the invalid field.
